    "created_at": "2021-02-15T23:53:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-15T23:53:58Z",
    "body": "PRs are always appreciated to implement your requested behavior. \r\n\r\nWe make the reasonable assumption that goal requests are coming in the same frame at the costmap https://github.com/ros-planning/navigation2/blob/main/nav2_navfn_planner/src/navfn_planner.cpp#L68 so if that's not the case, there's some clean up that could be done to support that. ",
