    "created_at": "2021-02-16T18:35:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-16T18:35:34Z",
    "body": "> Is this a feature you would like to see implemented, and if so, would you prefer is at a planner server or planner plugin level?\r\n\r\nPlanner server level. By the time it gets to the plugins, they should only be working with costmap coordinates. So I'd recommend checking the `frame_id` and transforming it to the costmap's global frame ID if different. Or at minimum doing what you suggest and issuing an error if its wrong and returning. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
